    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1048" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăd-urgĕo</span></b> ,
			ēre, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to press to</i> or <i>close to</i>, <i>press
				against.</i>—<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dens digito adurgendus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					7, 12, 1</span></i>
			.—<b>Poet.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(aliquem) remis volantem,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to pursue closely</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 1, 37, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
